<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's BNU cuts prime rate to 9.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Portugal's BNU cuts prime rate to 9.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese bank Banco Nacional Ultramarino, a unit of Caixa Geral de Depositos, said it had decided to cut its short term variable prime rate by 0.125 percentage points to 9.75 percent effective from November 25.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
